  "finalReply": "Built POV-Ray 2.2 from official archives:\n\n**Sources:** `http://www.povray.org/ftp/pub/povray/Old-Versions/Official-2.2/`\n- `POVSRC.TAR.Z` (562K, `source/` + `machine/` + legal docs)\n- `POVDOC.TAR.Z` (270K, `povdoc/` with `povdoc/include/` + docs/demo)\n- `POVSCN.TAR.Z` (727K, `povscn/scenes/`)\nDownloaded with `curl` to `/tmp/povdl/` and extracted with `tar xzf` to `/app/povray-2.2`, giving `source/ machine/ povdoc/ povscn/` + `povlegal.doc povinf.doc whatsnew.doc` etc. Fixed perms with `chmod -R a+rX` + `chown -R root:root` so `+L/app/povray-2.2/povdoc/include` is readable (`colors.inc shapes.inc textures.inc` present).\n\n**Build (UNIX non-X):**\n```bash\nmkdir /tmp/povbuild && cp /app/povray-2.2/source/* /tmp/povbuild/\ncp /app/povray-2.2/machine/unix/{unix.c,unix.mak,unixconf.h} /tmp/povbuild/\ncp unixconf.h config.h && cp unix.mak makefile\nmake CC=gcc  # cc -c -O ... + cc -o povray -O ... -lm (302K, Ver 2.2.u)\ncp /tmp/povbuild/povray /usr/local/bin/povray\n```\nRequired `gcc make unzip libc6-dev`. Build succeeds with only warnings (implicit `exit/qsort/rand`, `malloc` prototype).\n\n**Verified:**\n- `/usr/local/bin/povray +L/app/povray-2.2/povdoc/include +I/app/deps/illum1.pov +O/dev/null +P -V` completes: `Resolution 100x100, 91599 rays, 47187 reflected, 34412 refracted`.\n- `+FT` render to `/tmp/illum1_test.tga` deterministic (md5 `109732ae...` twice), `+FD` dump also works.",
